  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Could we get badges for accomplishments? Like say a badge called \"Green Giant\" for uploading so amount of avatars with green rating. Or \"World Creator\" for making your first world. Maybe if someone gets to like 100 worlds you could do \"Playing God\".\n\nYou could do cute icons using the VRCat like for \"Green Giant\" it could be green or simply wearing a green star. If you upload your first avatar it could be the VRCat playing dress-up or your first world it could be staring down at a globe neat things to encourage people more to do more and create. \n\nBadges for optimized content such as the \"Green Giant\" badge also encourages people to go in the right direction.",
